---
---
<section class="w-full bg-white py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 text-center">
    <h3 class="mb-10 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl">
      How We Collaborate
    </h3>

    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- Act -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 text-center">
        <svg
          class="mb-6 h-16 w-16 sm:h-20 sm:w-20 lg:h-24 lg:w-24 text-neutral-900"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"
        >
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" />
          <path d="M12 7v5l3 3" />
        </svg>
        <h4 class="mb-4 max-w-xs text-2xl font-bold">
          Act
        </h4>
        <p class="max-w-xs text-lg text-slate-500">
          Provide your requirements and employee persona to help us design a
          solution perfectly suited to your team's needs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Infer -->
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center p-8 text-center">
        <svg
          class="mb-6 h-16 w-16 sm:h-20 sm:w-20 lg:h-24 lg:w-24 text-neutral-900"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="1.5"
        >
          <path d="M12 3v18" />
          <path d="M5 12h14" />
        </svg>
        <h4 class="mb-4 max-w-xs text-2xl font-bold">
          Infer
        </h4>
        <p class="max-w-xs text-lg text-slate-500">
          We thoroughly assess your needs. Our specialists will evaluate and
          develop tailored simulation solutions designed to align perfectly with
          your employees' skill sets.
        </p>
      </div>
